      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "MENTAL MODEL: String = read-only slice without Cap. StringHeader = 16 bytes, just Ptr+Len.\n   Immutability = safe zero-copy sharing across goroutines without mutexes.\nITERATE: for i,r := range s { r=rune, i=byte offset }  |  strings.Builder for O(n) concatenation",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "MENTAL MODEL: String = read-only slice without Cap. StringHeader = 16 bytes, just Ptr+Len.\n   Immutability = safe zero-copy sharing across goroutines without mutexes.\nITERATE: for i,r := range s { r=rune, i=byte offset }  |  strings.Builder for O(n) concatenation",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
